// DefenseTech items that are gone from this server: no recipe and hidden from NEI. They're unobtainable rather than
// banned, so they carry no "Banned" mark. Explosives among them can't go off either (DefenseTech.cfg turns them off),
// so a leftover one is a dud, and House Rules takes them as unobtainable.
// Kept, but only from crates, envoy and bosses (DefenseTech.zs takes their recipes; houserules.json bans the ladder's
// explosive blocks and the bomb carts): the missiles of the ladder explosives (condensed, sonic, thermobaric, hypersonic, nuclear), gas
// (debilitation, chemical, contagious) and EMP; the condensed, debilitation and chemical grenades.
// Meta is DefenseTech's explosive id, in its registration order.

// shrapnel
recipes.remove(<DefenseTech:explosives:1>);
mods.nei.NEI.hide(<DefenseTech:explosives:1>);
